[{"text":"哦我亲爱的上帝啊，2019年竟然就这么过去了，仿佛从来没有开始过一样（？）。用一句话来总结这一年的话，可以说这一年是：「另一个和稀烂的数据一起摸爬滚打的一年」。这一年发生的事情还挺多，比如说「放弃读博计划，彻底决定不再做科研了」、「加入了回形针」、「博客大翻修」、「学习了 Rust」、「发现了很多好看的番剧」、「开始追漫画了」、「发现了很喜欢的游戏」之类的。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":0},{"text":"（前两天意外把写了一半的文章丢了上来，如果你收到了错误的 RSS 那么非常抱歉……）","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":1},{"text":"诺基亚 8110 荣获今年败家最成功奖： 一个功能机让我重新找回了使用电子设备的安全感，插着卡能待机两天，当无线热点用能用一下午。现在把那张美国的卡和中国的卡插在 8110 里面用，所谓的「智能机」则彻底沦落为了 MP4。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":2},{"text":"山灵 M0 荣获今年败家最失败奖： 真的是烂的由内而外自上而下……烂的很平均……按键非常容易误触，手感奇烂无比，存储卡动不动就找不到需要拔下来重插，系统本来就不好看，升级之后更难看了，媒体元信息读取逻辑异常弱智，读元信息的时候竟然还会对文件做出改动搞得我 rsync 都做不了，屏幕亮度范围也很不合理，调到最低真的就毛都看不见了，不推荐……","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":3},{"text":"羽博26800毫安移动电源（aka. 移动燃烧弹）荣获最佳便携武器奖： 支持 PD 快充的移动电源，买了一根苏菲的 PD 诱骗线（但那线质量是真杰宝次），这样就可以用移动电源给苏菲充电啦！基本上能撑一小天，配上诺记 8110 当移动基站，可以保证出去开会的时候一直有网络用。这套出门装除了重量很恐怖之外其实超爽的。对了，这个移动电源能上飞机。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":4},{"text":"九洲鹿泰国乳胶床垫荣获打出了最强伤害： 本年度购买的最失败的产品，睡了不到半年垫子就不回弹了，直接后果是我脆弱的腰直接硌到床板，加之我平时坐姿没那么好，所以又腰成功被操翻……每天都是从早痛到晚……","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":5},{"text":"卡莱饰人体工学腰垫成为了最强治愈武器： 腰开始不舒服之后就买了这个腰垫，这个腰垫对腰部支撑非常好，身体靠上去真的很舒服，妥了这个腰垫的福，现在腰上的酸痛感已经恢复很多了。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":6},{"text":"吉大一院的年度体检报告成为最实用生活指南： 如果你已经工作了，强烈建议每年做一个大体检，身上有啥毛病抓紧治。春节那会做的体检查出了鸡蛋和牛奶过敏，解决了我长久以来的腹泻问题。把鸡蛋和牛奶忌了之后就没再拉肚子了。以及因为有高尿酸血症，家里史上有痛风史，所以谨遵医嘱很多高嘌呤食物也给忌了。现在进食堂是真的没啥可吃的，大崩溃 ╰(〒皿〒)╯。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":7},{"text":"Pirahana Mobile 荣获情绪复杂奖： 今年搞了几张美国的手机卡用来注册国内各种厂商的垃圾账号，算是在隐私保护方面的「自慰」行为吧。Pirahana Mobile 他家的胜在月费便宜，不过英国版的手机号会收不到 Twitter 的短信、且仅支持 2G，你用他家的卡给国内的手机号发短信也会收不到，所以这个产品让我情绪非常复杂……","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":8},{"text":"要考北京师范大学的男生请注意，北京师范大学研究生宿舍学 4 楼（又称A座），一楼、五楼、十楼、十一楼全都在闹床虫！你应当把这件事情当作择校条件之一！这破虫子简直是最高等级生物危害！而且根本根除不干净！你在学校不杀干净了放假回家铁定会带回家！","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":9},{"text":"我们楼层一圈的宿舍全都遭重了！就是那种，西瓜子大小的，繁殖非常旺盛的虫子！","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":10},{"text":"现在我们这边唯一的有效解决办法是，把所有的衣服、书、床单被罩等微观结构有孔的东西，全都用黑色塑料袋包好，送到楼顶的天台，用夏天的大太阳暴晒两周，或者冬天零下的天气冻一个月以上，以确保虫子全部被杀死。同时推荐所有耐高温的衣服都要过一遍热水把虫子烫死。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":11},{"text":"当时掀开床帘的时候看见头顶密密麻麻一大坨正在爬的虫子的画面直击心灵造成了不可逆的精神损伤……事后处理床帘的时候，我和我室友把自己的床帘床单放进大箱子里面反复的烫，烫了一天之后倒出废水顺出来了无数的虫子……一颗一颗的，就跟泡了水的黑米饭一样……一层的虫子……","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":12},{"text":"现在在做的这个项目也很有趣，估计很快就会和各位见面了。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":13},{"text":"找工作的过程非常曲折，一月份会写一篇文章好好说说这段时间的有趣经历的www。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":14},{"text":"螺莉莉这个人设算是今年稳定下来了吧，年中的时候找玖妖老师帮忙画了新版本的头像，参考了饭卡上的照片，比较遗憾的是没画出那种看不见希望看不见爱的眼神（。同时也换上了新域名 roriri.one，圆滚滚的可爱死了 > <~。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":15},{"text":"评选标准：节奏必须稳，剧本别崩，作画有没有都无所谓，音乐好听更好。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":16},{"text":"入选 2019 莉莉杯年度最佳番剧奖的作品有：","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":17},{"text":"彼方的阿斯特拉：科幻题材作品，讲的是一群参加宇宙旅行的学生因事故遇难，在宇宙中找家的故事。严肃内容和搞笑内容调和的非常合理，该搞笑的时候笑点足够强，该深入讨论问题的时候下潜的足够深（超能力女儿在这方面与本作形成了鲜明对比，主要是剧情太矫情）。尤其前期埋的线索在后期连续爆炸给我带来了非常强烈的震撼。除此之外本番的作画质量也算上乘，非常推荐有时间刷一刷。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":18},{"text":"GIVEN 被赠与的未来：讲的是一群男生组建乐队的故事。本来是当音乐番看的，看了两集才发现是小基番。不过！你们这群卖肉恋爱番都好好看看人家这剧情推的有多稳！节奏控制的有多好！音乐有多上心！番这东西啊！不是疯狂卖大胸大屁股就可以的！太野犬了！","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":19},{"text":"入间同学入魔了：讲的是被父母卖给恶魔的男主，人了买家当爷爷，还被爷爷送进恶魔学校学习的校园搞笑番。热血、搞笑、感情戏都来一点点搅一搅就是本番了。笑点优质，叙事不罗嗦是我推荐本番的一大原因。同样都是搞笑番但是这个番看起来比「比方的阿斯特拉」更轻松一些，如果你生活压力本身就很大的话推荐看看这部放松一下。我把这部和 Kill Me Baby, 白熊咖啡厅放在同一个门类里，是我看番以来最推荐的三部轻松搞笑番。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":20},{"text":"书虫的下克上：书痴女主不幸转生到没有印刷技术的异世界的故事。虽然作画真的穷，但是每集看的还是很享受。对于家庭关系、女主和男主之间的情感关系都描述的恰如其分，丝毫没有粘腻感。「进度条过半警告！」、「咦？这就没了？！」「草（一种植物）」。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":21},{"text":"不吉波普不笑：电波系作品，跟我电波对上了，所以很推荐。说实话从头到尾我都没有看的太明白，不过整个作品烘托的氛围非常好，这成为了我推荐本作的原因。另外香菜真棒 o(￣︶￣)o。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":22},{"text":"PSYCHO-PASS 3：时间轴在第二季之后，对第一部作品的核心精神做了很好的继承和延续。前两集还活着的主要角色你基本都能看到（包括第一季的角色！），除此以外打戏依旧很好看。但是说实话剧本稍显俗套，而且最后一集的发展真的挺平庸的，期待明年剧场版会怎么走吧。如果你是系列老粉推荐补一下这部，但是看的时候别太走心，续作很少有能越做越好的。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":23},{"text":"其他非常推荐的作品还有:Dr.STONE、慎重勇者。都是非常好的作品，限于文笔拙劣不多作介绍。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":24},{"text":"以及今年最雷的三个片是：《你妈连击带顺劈》、《琴之森 2》、《RobiHachi》。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":25},{"text":"《刀剑神域》剧情节奏崩的一塌糊涂同样让我感到失望。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":26},{"text":"入选 2019 莉莉杯年度最佳音乐的作品有：","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":27},{"text":"Level Off - Night Tempo, Super Brass：劲爆爽曲！萨克斯的部分太加分了。走在大街上听到这首曲子是会像白痴一样晃起来的。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":28},{"text":"长大的生活 - 廖文强、曾博恩：啊，为什么节奏那么欢快但是听着这首曲子就是笑不出来呢 TvT~","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":29},{"text":"我们一样可惜 - Full Band ver. - 好乐团, 玛啡因：悲伤系音乐组合的知名曲目，某句歌词算是戳到我内心当中的某个点了。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":30},{"text":"Wave of Light (Live) - 高木正勝：强烈建议买正版、完整版、Live版来听，第一次听到这首曲子的时候感受到了极强的震撼。这首曲子不仅有着日本传统音乐的韵味，还传递出了非常强烈的「快乐的」情绪，高木老师真的是个神人。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":31},{"text":"逃生口 - 原子邦妮：MV赞！黄大谦超帅的！而且整个 MV 对当代「网红」所面对的精神压力刻画的很到位。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":32},{"text":"Aloha de Chocobo - Cat Trumpet：把原本很搞笑的音乐用一种一本正经且抒情的方式演奏出来真的让人……忍不住笑出声……","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":33},{"text":"AI: 梦境档案：剧情向的科幻推理故事，推荐的原因主要是剧本很好。Q君在B站上做了实况，叙事逻辑很自洽，虽然科幻但是也没有扯得很远。整个国庆假期生病卧床就指着这个游戏活了。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":34},{"text":"VA-11 HALL-A：科幻日常剧情向黄油（？），不，并不黄……是一部能让人内心平静下来的作品，B站皮皮做了实况，不想上手推的可以直接去看视频。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":35},{"text":"对了，推荐所有看了实况的朋友去 Steam 补个票，支持厂商做出更好的作品。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":36},{"text":"STR Network：博恩夜夜秀真是极品节目，用非常轻松的方式让观众了解了「政治」是什么。尤其对于中国大陆这种人民普遍缺乏政治参与感的地方，通过这类节目补一下公民教育还是很有必要的。除此之外志祺七七 X 圖文不符也是个不错的频道，感兴趣都可以刷刷。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":37},{"text":"回形针 Paperclip：全球范围内，还有视频制作比我司精良的吗！没有！尤其卫生纸那期的片头简直惊死我了！","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":38},{"text":"最佳番剧： 《彼方的阿斯特拉》，特别提名《GIVEN 被赠与的未来》；","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":39},{"text":"最佳音乐： 《Wave of Light (Live)》 - 高木正勝","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":40},{"text":"学了新语言！：学了一些比较 Fashion 的东西，比如 Julia 和 Rust，在自己分析数据的时候也开始用 Julia 处理一些东西了；","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":41},{"text":"造了方轮子！：学习 Julia macro 的副产物 MATT.jl （和 Shiny 比较类似的东西），学习小波分析的副产物 PowerWavelet.jl（翻译了一遍 WaveletComp.R）；","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":42},{"text":"找到了实习！：在回形针写代码，周六周日远程实习，主要是重构代码库里面一些思路不太清晰的代码，做一下移动端适配，这事挺烧脑细胞的，估计要做好久；","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":43},{"text":"GitHub！：还行，比去年点亮的天数多一些？","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":44},{"text":"数学？：学习了很多信号分析相关的知识，一本满足！","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":45},{"text":"写作！：15篇，有三篇我觉得还不错，分别是 「那些有画风毒的开源许可证」、「依恋与爱情」、「简单易懂的统计学入门：自下而上（一）」。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":46},{"text":"多写几篇文章，目前在列表里的有：统计学系类填坑、信号处理系列开坑、性别议题讨论、精神娱乐消费问题讨论；","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":47},{"text":"希望能成为像李先生和破先生一样有趣的博客作家 _(:3 」∠ )_。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":48},{"text":"总之，这是今年最后一篇文章了，接下来也要休息一段时间了，还有什么想写的明年再说吧，提前祝大家圣诞快乐、新年快乐。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":49},{"text":"我一直在思考 Bilibili 搞的一键三连是不是一个比较蠢的行为，点赞投币收藏这三个事情本来就有不同的触发阻力，强行绑在一起会让三个指标一起失真，变成了很接近二元的东西，而且很难通过矫正回归把它纠回去。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":50},{"text":"最近一直在思考一个问题，从人体工学的角度来看，椅子可能压根不应该有椅背……","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":51},{"text":"梦见现实变成一个喜剧演员设计的超粪游戏，我选择了一个奇妙种族，自己变成一颗橙色 bb 弹一样的角色，可惜长成一张超大的，血管质感的网，敌军踩在上面就会受伤害，然后被吸收。此处引述人森台词：我最近是不是太累了（ry","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":52},{"text":"我们老师有告诉我们，求职的时候如果问你期望薪资，永远不要给出数字，只回答我认为贵公司有一个公允的标准。如果 hr 非常白目，再你强调两次之后依然坚持要你提供数字，给他一个模糊的行业薪资一般范围。当然，这属于不同国家对同样问题的处理方法不一样了。","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":53},{"text":"《画完这个再去死》真的是我这季度最喜欢的作品。通常番剧到中期后劲就会开始变弱了。但是这一部完全没有看到往下掉的趋势，情绪能量和叙事的力道依然给的非常非常足，而且完全不矫情、不做作、不说教，到底是怎么做到的……","maxWidthPx":720,"fontFamilies":"IBM Plex Sans SC","fontSizePx":20,"lineHeightPx":30,"locale":"zh-Hans","fontWeight":400,"italic":false,"firstLineIndentIc":2,"sourceBoundaries":"","textSpans":"","inlineBoxes":"","lineBreakSpans":"","index":54}]